This dongle is probably an [[AboCom WUG2650]] / [[AboCom WUG2654|WUG2654]]. :This adapter is on [http://foro.seguridadwireless.net/live-cd-wifislax/wifislax-y-zydax-solucionado-tanto-en-live-conmo-en-hdd/?wap2 this list] as an [[RFMD]] RF2959 unit.
